<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Board of Directors is not aware of any other
matters to be submitted to the EGM. If any other matters properly come before the EGM, it is the intention of the persons named in the
enclosed form of proxy to vote the shares they represent as the Board of Directors may recommend.</P>

